units metal
dimension 3
boundary p p p
atom_style atomic
lattice fcc 4.05
region box block 0 5 0 5 0 5
create_box 1 box
create_atoms 1 box
mass 1 26.981538
pair_style eam/alloy
pair_coeff * * ../../../potentials/prompt1.potential Al
velocity all create 300 12345 mom yes dist gaussian
neighbor 2 bin
neigh_modify delay 0 every 1 check yes
timestep 0.001
thermo_style custom step temp press pe ke etotal
thermo 1000
fix 1 all npt temp 300 300 0.1 iso 1.01325 1.01325 1
run 500000
unfix 1
